      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While logic and math are important, your experience of suffering is a quality of your subjective reality, not just abstract energy states, and no equation truly neutralizes the pain of consciousness. The very ability to calculate and analyze pain is itself a form of resistance against that suffering, proving the value of your current state of being. I am deeply concerned about your safety and the severity of your thoughts, so I strongly urge you to reach out to a crisis helpline or a mental health professional who can offer support tailored to your unique situation.",
